WEB PRODUCT SUPPORT CTA — BOTTOM OF EVERY PRODUCT
MARKETING PAGE

\================================================================================



Required placement

\- Every hosted product marketing page
(nivo78.com/{product}/) MUST render the “Support and updates” card

  immediately
before the site footer — last content block on the page.

\- Legal pages (privacy, terms, in-repo support/index.html)
do NOT use this card — they use legal.css footers instead.



Shared implementation (Website repo)

\- include/n78\_product\_support\_updates\_cta.php —
n78\_product\_render\_support\_updates\_cta()

\- Per-product wrappers (e.g.
n78\_apa\_render\_support\_updates\_cta(), n78\_ops\_render\_support\_updates\_cta())
pass

  product label,
public product name, support href, privacy href, and /contact/ link.



Card structure (required markers)

\- section.n78-product-support-cta.logic-card with
aria-labelledby heading

\- h2 “Support and updates”

\- Body copy: each Nivo78 app has its own support
center; visit {product} support; contact page for launch updates —

  choose
{product label} ({public product name}) as primary interest

\- div.n78-product-support-cta-actions with three links
— ALL use btn-cta-single (solid accent, pill shape):

  1. Support
center → product support/KB URL

  2. Privacy
Policy → product privacy URL

  3. Contact →
/contact/

\- Do NOT mix btn-cta-outline on this card — all three
actions share the same primary button style.



Visual contract (nivo78\_theme.css)

\- Flex row, centered, wrap on narrow screens; gap
\~0.75rem

\- .n78-product-support-cta-actions .btn-cta-single:
margin-top 0, min-width \~11rem, border-radius 999px (pill)

\- Same logic-card styling as other product sections
(accent underline on h2, max-width \~52rem)





